bluejetty:00029552:ios.description:
Visual Choices provides an easy way to communicate, and develops natural speech.
It is made for early communicators with autism.
Developed with early intervention experts and trusted by speech therapists, special education teachers, clinical directors, parents, and grandparents.
The app:
• Helps you discover what your child wants by making it easy to present choices;
• Uses photos your child will respond to;
• Promotes speech with lip animations and visual phonics;
• Builds language with integrated AAC and signing videos;
• Provides access to over 50,000 SymbolStix pictures;
• Lets you type and dictate into the AAC sentence bar;
• Enables easy modeling with voice-to-highlight;
• Lets you convert your voice to instant choices for on-the-fly use;
• Lets you print out boards as a no-tech option;
• Lets you make choices with eye gaze for hands-free use;
• Can be used offline;
• Supports English, Spanish, and Russian;
• Works on its own or alongside an existing AAC system.
Terms of use: https://skieslearn.com/visualchoices_terms_of_service

